orts commits MOP 1.37 billion. JPMorgan cuts target for Wynn Resorts stock - ad-hoc-news.de","src":"ad-hoc-news.de","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-25","zh":"永利度假村投入13.7億澳門元。摩根大通下調永利度假村股票目標 - ad-hoc-news.de"},{"title":"Wynn Resorts, Limited (WYNN) Options Chain - Yahoo Finance","src":"Yahoo! Finance Canada","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMikgFBVV95cUxQTHp6MU1jZVJXSnJwbVRlWUxWYWZPY3Q0aTJNM2FNY084b2F6YUVUNVN3MmNxQ0ZZQzgxRWk3cnZwN2dTUkFmQnUwY2lhdzVoZ2lzTWd0X3FLc1RGQmFObDR5eUl5V3NDYmFUVV9OZnVncnlyMmUwZ3A5N3dYRHBDVlg0S0FHTkl2TjVCOVdSUHcxdw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"永利度假村有限公司 (WYNN) 選擇權鏈 - 雅虎財經"},{"title":"Form 8K Wynn Resorts Limited For: 23 October By Investing.com","src":"Investing.com UK","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxQOENHLWJyLVQtb1FmYnNTT21nYm5ldmxIVlQtYkk0NkhlYlhfM29lSllZakRkQ1Q4bUNhUzJ5ZV9FNVJ0WDNBaVFKTkd5SkdMQXJNVmJPbXdqY0ZOMkRrN09EUVlKdVBFWnplSnkyN0Nhdjl2NGNKZ2FKTDczNnR3Z1FvbXF5emU4UGhDa2dKckxTYlkxV1RPc0ZqMllUUFo2eVUzODIyZw?oc=5","date":"2026-10-23","zh":"8K 表格 Wynn Resorts Limited 有效期限：10 月 23 日 由 Investing.com 提供"},{"title":"Wynn Resorts, Limited (NASDAQ:WYNN) Stock Has Average Price Target of $130.12 According to Brokerages","src":"MarketBeat","url":"https://news.google.?oc=5","date":"2026-10-18","zh":"券商稱永利度假村有限公司（納斯達克股票代碼：WYNN）股票的平均目標價為 130.12 美元"},{"title":"Wynn Resorts (WYNN) Edges Lower to $75.15 as Traders Eye $71.39 Support - High Reward Trades","src":"https://www.dars.gov.et/","url":"https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxOSl80ZnRqVmlvY0xJNzkwdzdiQV9sdV9MUFhIME9mTnNrTDZ3VlNlUTBSTFRiR0lNaGhhQk1qWG1vRmc5b2hZcnNnSThXYmRkX1luWG82cTJWS3FQYmVlUFlpOW1jVWU5d1U4aGx1MVM3UkxHQW5LVVZDMGxlWWl2TU85Y0JtLWwyTlJPaVRFV2wtUzY3WmhSUy1MV2NMTW9tLVNieHZ6WjBrbjA?oc=5","date":"2026-10-11","zh":"永利度假村（WYNN）小幅下跌至 75.15 美元，交易者關注 71.39 美元的支撐位 - 高回報交易"}],"themes":[{"name":"財報","count":3},{"name":"分析師評等","count":3}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-03-02","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1174922/000117492226000013/wynn-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Wynn Resorts, Limited (\"Wynn Resorts,\" \"Wynn,\" or together with its subsidiaries, \"we\" or the \"Company\") is a preeminent designer, developer, and operator of integrated resorts featuring luxury hotel rooms, high-end retail space, an array of dining and entertainment options, meeting and convention facilities, and gaming, all supported by an unparalleled focus on our guests, our people, and our community. We believe that our extensive design and operational experience across numerous gaming jurisdictions provides us with a distinct advantage over other gaming enterprises.","zh":"永利度假村有限公司（「永利度假村」、「永利」或連同其子公司統稱「我們」或「公司」）是一家卓越的綜合度假村設計商、開發商和營運商，其特色包括豪華酒店客房、高端零售空間、一系列餐飲和娛樂選擇、會議設施以及博彩，所有這些都以對我們的客人、我們的員工和我們的社區的無與倫比的關注為支持。我們相信，我們在眾多博彩司法管轄區的豐富設計和營運經驗為我們提供了優於其他博彩企業的獨特優勢。"},{"en":"Through our approximately 72% ownership of Wynn Macau, Limited (\"WML\"), we operate two integrated resorts in the Macau Special Administrative Region of the People's Republic of China (\"Macau\"), Wynn Palace and Wynn Macau (collectively, our \"Macau Operations\"). In Las Vegas, Nevada, we operate and, with the exception of certain retail space, own 100% of Wynn Las Vegas and Encore at Wynn Las Vegas, which we also refer to as our Las Vegas Operations. In Everett, Massachusetts, we operate Encore Boston Harbor, an integrated resort. Additionally, the Company has a 40% equity interest in Island 3 AMI FZ-LLC, an unconsolidated affiliate, which is constructing an integrated resort property (\"Wynn Al Marjan Island\") in Ras Al Khaimah, United Arab Emirates, currently expected to open in 2027.","zh":"透過我們持有永利澳門有限公司（「WML」）約72%的股權，我們在中華人民共和國澳門特別行政區（「澳門」）經營兩座綜合度假村：永利皇宮和永利澳門（統稱為「澳門業務」）。在內華達州拉斯維加斯，除某些零售空間外，我們經營並擁有 Wynn Las Vegas 和 Encore at Wynn Las Vegas 的 100% 股權，我們也稱之為拉斯維加斯業務。在麻薩諸塞州埃弗里特，我們經營安可波士頓港綜合度假村。此外，該公司還擁有Island 3 AMI FZ-LLC（一家未合併附屬公司）40%的股權，該公司正在阿拉伯聯合大公國哈伊馬角建設綜合度假村（「Wynn Al Marjan Island」），目前預計將於2027年開業。"},{"en":"We conceptualize, design, build, and operate our resorts to create unforgettable customer experiences across a diverse set of gaming and non-gaming amenities that attract a wide range of customer segments and generate strong financial results.","zh":"我們構思、設計、建造和營運我們的度假村，旨在透過各種遊戲和非遊戲設施創造令人難忘的客戶體驗，吸引廣泛的客戶群並產生強勁的財務業績。"}],"markets":[{"en":"The casino resort industry is highly competitive. We compete with other high-quality resorts on the basis of the range of amenities, level of service, price, location, entertainment, themes and size, among other factors. We seek to differentiate our integrated resorts by delivering superior design and customer service.","zh":"赌场度假村行业竞争非常激烈。我們在設施範圍、服務水準、價格、位置、娛樂、主題和規模等因素上與其他高品質度假村競爭。我們力求透過提供卓越的設計和客戶服務來使我們的綜合度假村脫穎而出。"},{"en":"Macau, located in the Greater Bay Area, is governed as a special administrative region of China and is located approximately 37 miles southwest of Hong Kong. The journey between Macau and Hong Kong takes approximately 15 minutes by helicopter, 30 minutes by road via the Hong Kong-Zhuhai-Macau Bridge, and one hour by jetfoil ferry. Macau, which has been a casino destination for more than 60 years, consists principally of a peninsula on mainland China and two neighboring islands, Taipa and Coloane, between which the Cotai area is located. In addition to Wynn Resorts (Macau) S.A. (\"Wynn Macau SA\"), SJM Resorts, S.A. (\"SJM\"), Galaxy Casino, S.A. (\"Galaxy\"), Venetian Macau, S.A. (\"Venetian Macau\"), Melco Resorts (Macau) Limited (\"Melco\"), and MGM Grand Paradise Limited (\"MGM Macau\") are permitted to operate casinos in Macau, with a total of 20 casinos currently in operation.","zh":"澳門位於大灣區，是中國的特別行政區，位於香港西南方約 37 英里處。澳門與香港之間搭乘直升機約 15 分鐘，經港珠澳大橋陸路約 30 分鐘，搭乘噴射渡輪約 1 小時。澳門作為賭場勝地已有 60 多年的歷史，主要由中國大陸的一個半島和兩個鄰近的島嶼——氹仔島和路環島——組成，路氹地區位於這兩個島嶼之間。除永利渡假村（澳門）有限公司（「永利澳門SA」）外，SJM Resorts, S.A.（「澳博」）、銀河娛樂場S.A.（「銀河」）、澳門威尼斯人股份有限公司（「澳門威尼斯人」）、新濠博亞度假村（澳門）有限公司（「新濠」）及美高梅金殿天堂有限公司（「澳門美高梅」）有限公司獲準在澳門賭場，總數為目前正在經營的澳門賭場 20 家。"}],"customers":[{"en":"Both the Macau gaming market and visitation to Macau have grown significantly since liberalization in 2002. According to the Macau Statistics and Census Service Monthly Bulletin of Statistics, visitation to Macau in 2025 increased 14.7%, 42.0% and 602.9% compared to 2024, 2023 and 2022, respectively. We believe that the Macau region hosts one of the world's largest concentrations of potential gaming and tourism customers. According to Macau Statistical Information, annual gaming revenues have increased to $30.9 billion, $28.4 billion, and $22.7 billion in 2025, 2024, and 2023, respectively. We continue to believe that Macau's stated goal of becoming a world-class tourism destination will continue to drive additional visitation to the market and create future opportunities for us to invest and grow.","zh":"自2002年開放以來，澳門博彩市場和澳門遊客量均大幅成長。根據澳門統計暨普查局統計月報，2025年澳門遊客量較2024年、2023年及2022年分別成長14.7%、42.0%及602.9%。我們相信，澳門地區是全球潛在博彩和旅遊客戶最集中的地區之一。根據澳門統計資料顯示，2025年、2024年及2023年，年度博弈收入分別增加至309億美元、284億美元及227億美元。我們仍然相信，澳門成為世界級旅遊目的地的既定目標將繼續推動市場的成長，並為我們創造未來的投資和成長機會。"}],"competition":[],"segments":{"seg":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Las Vegas Operations","val":2573035000,"zh":"拉斯維加斯業務"},{"name":"Encore Boston Harbor","val":846872000,"zh":"安可波士頓港"}],"total":7137924000},"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Casino","val":4410328000,"zh":"賭場"},{"name":"Occupancy","val":1141154000,"zh":"佔用"},{"name":"Food & Beverage","val":1037850000,"zh":"食品及飲料"},{"name":"Entertainment Retail & Other","val":548592000,"zh":"娛樂零售及其他"}],"total":7137924000}},"peers":["LVS","MGM","CZR","PENN","MAR"]}}